        <object label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_AWKWARD — Awkward canyon.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You are in an awkward sloping east/west canyon.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;DEPRE → LOC_GRATE · 01 — Surface World [not GRATE=GRATE_CLOSED]&lt;br&gt;ENTRA → LOC_BELOWGRATE&lt;br&gt;d → LOC_DEBRIS&lt;br&gt;INWAR → LOC_BIRDCHAMBER&lt;br&gt;PIT → LOC_PITTOP" source_id="LOC_AWKWARD" description_en="You are in an awkward sloping east/west canyon." description_es="" short_en="" maptag="Awkward canyon." chapter_id="CH_ENTRY" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_AWKWARD" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="">
