        </object>
        <object label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_CRACK — The crack is far too small for you to follow.  At...&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The crack is far too small for you to follow.  At its widest it is&lt;br&gt;barely wide enough to admit your foot.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;(implicit) → LOC_PITTOP" source_id="LOC_CRACK" description_en="The crack is far too small for you to follow.  At its widest it is&#10;barely wide enough to admit your foot." description_es="" short_en="" maptag="" chapter_id="CH_ENTRY" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_CRACK" review_status="ok" role="transient" conditions="DEEP=True">
