        <object label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_EASTBANK — on east bank of fissure&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You are on the east bank of a fissure slicing clear across the hall.&lt;br&gt;The mist is quite thick here, and the fissure is too wide to jump.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;HALL → LOC_MISTHALL&lt;br&gt;JUMP → say CROSS_BRIDGE [not FISSURE=UNBRIDGED]&lt;br&gt;FORWA → LOC_NOMAKE · 11 — Special &amp;amp; Transient States [not FISSURE=BRIDGED]&lt;br&gt;OVER → say NO_CROSS [not FISSURE=BRIDGED]&lt;br&gt;OVER → LOC_WESTBANK" source_id="LOC_EASTBANK" description_en="You are on the east bank of a fissure slicing clear across the hall.&#10;The mist is quite thick here, and the fissure is too wide to jump." description_es="" short_en="You're on east bank of fissure." maptag="" chapter_id="CH_ENTRY" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_EASTBANK" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="DEEP=True" objects_here="FISSURE" immovable_objects_here="FISSURE">
