        <object label="&lt;b&gt;LOC_MISTHALL — in Hall of Mists&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You are at one end of a vast hall stretching forward out of sight to&lt;br&gt;the west.  There are openings to either side.  Nearby, a wide stone&lt;br&gt;staircase leads downward.  The hall is filled with wisps of white mist&lt;br&gt;sw&lt;br&gt;[... full description stored in node metadata ...]&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EXITS (source order)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;left → LOC_NUGGET&lt;br&gt;FORWA → LOC_EASTBANK&lt;br&gt;STAIR → LOC_KINGHALL · 03 — Hall of Mountain King &amp;amp; Twopit&lt;br&gt;UPWAR → LOC_DOME · 11 — Special &amp;amp; Transient States [carry NUGGET]&lt;br&gt;UPWAR → LOC_PITTOP&lt;br&gt;Y2 → LOC_JUMBLE · 10 — Y2, Windows &amp;amp; Dusty Room" source_id="LOC_MISTHALL" description_en="You are at one end of a vast hall stretching forward out of sight to&#10;the west.  There are openings to either side.  Nearby, a wide stone&#10;staircase leads downward.  The hall is filled with wisps of white mist&#10;swaying to and fro almost as if alive.  A cold wind blows up the&#10;staircase.  There is a passage at the top of a dome behind you." description_es="" short_en="You're in Hall of Mists." maptag="" chapter_id="CH_ENTRY" source_reference="Open_Adventure.yaml locations/LOC_MISTHALL" review_status="ok" role="playable" conditions="DEEP=True" objects_here="STEPS" immovable_objects_here="STEPS" sound="WIND_WHISTLES">
          <mxCell id="CH_ENTRY_LOC_MISTHALL" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
            <mxGeometry x="800" y="920" width="300" height="340" as="geometry" />
